<%- include("partials/header",{title:"CMS Game Database"}) %><main class="lightPage adminKnowledgePage"><section class="lightTitle"><div class="wrap"><div class="pageEyebrow">CMS Workspace</div><h1>Game Database & Knowledge</h1><p>Review the structured EverLeaf knowledge snapshot that powers the public Wiki, including source coverage and verification state. Publishing remains read-only while draft/review controls are built.</p></div></section><%- include("partials/admin-manager-nav") %><div class="cmsWorkspace knowledgeWorkspace"><section class="cmsPanel knowledgeMain"><div class="cmsManagerTitle"><div><h2>Knowledge Library</h2><p><%=results.length%> of <%=entries.length%> structured entries shown · <%=verifiedCount%> carry verification metadata.</p></div><a class="btn small" href="/wiki" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Public Wiki ↗</a></div><div class="knowledgeSummary"><div><small>Structured articles</small><strong><%=entries.length%></strong></div><div><small>Categories</small><strong><%=categories.length%></strong></div><div><small>Source documents represented</small><strong><%=sources.length%></strong></div><div><small>Verification coverage</small><strong><%=entries.length?Math.round((verifiedCount/entries.length)*100):0%>%</strong></div></div><form class="knowledgeFilters" method="get" action="/admin/knowledge"><input type="search" name="q" value="<%=q%>" placeholder="Search systems, jobs, NX, launcher…"><select name="category"><option value="all">All categories</option><% categories.forEach(cat=>{ %><option value="<%=cat.key%>" <%=category===cat.key?'selected':''%>><%=cat.label%></option><% }) %></select><button class="btn primary">FILTER</button><% if(q||category!=='all'){ %><a class="btn" href="/admin/knowledge">CLEAR</a><% } %></form><div class="knowledgeTableWrap"><table class="knowledgeTable"><thead><tr><th>Article</th><th>Category</th><th>Status</th><th>Source / verification</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><% results.forEach(entry=>{ %><tr><td><strong><%=entry.title%></strong><small><%=entry.summary%></small></td><td><%=categories.find(c=>c.key===entry.category)?.label||entry.category%></td><td><span class="knowledgeStatus"><%=entry.status%></span></td><td><small class="knowledgeSource"><b><%=entry.sourceDoc||entry.source%></b><span><%=entry.verification||'Library curated'%></span></small></td><td><a class="btn small" href="/wiki/<%=entry.slug%>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View</a></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table><% if(!results.length){ %><div class="knowledgeEmpty">No entries match these filters.</div><% } %></div></section><aside class="cmsPanel knowledgeCoverage"><div class="cmsManagerTitle"><h2>Coverage</h2><p>Current library-backed public coverage.</p></div><div class="coverageList"><% coverage.forEach(cat=>{ %><a href="/admin/knowledge?category=<%=cat.key%>"><span><strong><%=cat.label%></strong><small><%=cat.description%></small></span><b><%=cat.count%></b></a><% }) %></div><div class="knowledgeSourceCoverage"><div class="pageEyebrow">SOURCE COVERAGE</div><h3>EverleafMS documents</h3><% sources.forEach(source=>{ %><div><span><%=source.doc%></span><b><%=source.count%></b></div><% }) %></div><div class="knowledgeRoadmap"><div class="pageEyebrow">IMPORT ROADMAP</div><h3>Next database families</h3><ul><li>Skills & advancement requirements</li><li>Monsters & bosses</li><li>Items & equipment</li><li>Map/NPC machine-readable ledger</li><li>Quests, drops & shops</li></ul><p>These will use the same source/status model and later gain draft → review → publish controls with audit logging.</p></div></aside></div></main><%- include("partials/footer") %>
